# The open-mercato skill collection is vendored: `.claude/skills/om-*` and skills-lock.json are
# committed, byte-identical to the SHA pinned in .ai/cezar/config.json. `pnpm install-skills`
# refreshes them and the pin moves in the same commit (docs/agents/cezar.md).

# Per-run artefacts of the om pipeline. The launchers .ai/scripts/test-env-*.sh stay tracked
# so a fresh Cezar worktree can boot the QA environment.
.ai/qa/test-env.json
.ai/qa/test-env.env
.ai/qa/test-env.lock/
.ai/qa/test-env-boot.log
.ai/qa/test-env-build-cache.json
.ai/qa/artifacts_*/
.ai/tmp/
